16/2008/QH12, may register for voluntary rehabilitation according to regulations of this Law. Time spent serving compulsory rehabilitation in communities may be counted towards the voluntary rehabilitation duration;

d) Persons who are to be sent to rehabilitation centers for compulsory rehabilitation according to regulations of the Law on Drug Prevention and Fight No. 23/2000/QH10, which is amended in compliance with Law No.
16/2008/QH12, and whose applications for compulsory rehabilitation in rehabilitation centers are being formulated shall undergo rehabilitation in compliance with this Law;

